# ***Seamlessly Transition Through Project Phases***

For most cities, finishing a registration or disposition isn't the end of the work. Compliance and monitoring come next, and handing off between those phases is where things can slip through the cracks.

Slate can now kick off those follow-up processes automatically as soon as a registration or disposition is complete. The next phase starts on its own, with the same property record, so the whole process stays streamlined from start to finish.

Questions? [Connect with your Customer Success Manager](mailto:support@tolemi.com) and we're happy to walk you through it.
